### Gateway Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/gateway/status

###

### Rate Limit Test - Client A (Run this multiple times quickly to hit limit)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/gateway/rate-limit-test?clientId=clientA

###

### Rate Limit Test - Client B (Different client, separate limit)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/gateway/rate-limit-test?clientId=clientB

###

### Health Check (Custom)
GET http://localhost:8080/health

###

### Health Check (Actuator)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

###

### Actuator Info
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/info

